Hello @<%= @sponsor %>,

This is a friendly reminder that your current sponsorship invoice balance will expire and be reduced to $0.00 USD on <%= @zero_balance_date_formatted %>.

To avoid any disruption, please request a new invoice before <%= @zero_balance_date_formatted %>. If your account has insufficient funds, your recurring sponsorships may be canceled.

You can check your current balance in your Sponsors Dashboard: <%= org_sponsoring_url(@sponsor) %>

Create a new invoice to refill your balance: <%= @new_invoice_url %>

Questions or need assistance refilling your balance? Please contact us at <%= GitHub.support_url %>.

Thank you for supporting the open source community!

The GitHub Sponsors Team
